            "0": "Unfortunately, I cannot.  At least, not fully, but I can make out a few words.  This confirms that the denzigns of the tower were linked with the evil threatening the land.\n\nI will send this on to the Church of All Gods in the Border Hills.  I believe someone there can make out the script and hopefully this evil will soon be cleansed from my forest, and all the nearby lands.\n\nYou have done well, <FirstName>. "
