        "Text": {
          "type": "cexolocstring",
          "value": {
            "0": "I take my men out each day to drive back the evil creatures, but each night they seem to return.  It is a constant battle we have gotten ourselves into, and I wonder if it will ever end.\n\nTwo days ago I tracked a strange creature to an abandoned tower east of the road in the Western Black Forest.  I could not get close without being seen, but I think that the tower may hold the key to our current situation."
